        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIIIAtr">VIII Atr</ref> 14</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">And ealle Godes gerihta firðrige man georne, ealswa hit þearf is.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And all God's dues shall be promptly rendered, as the occasion requires.</ab>
